{"id":"vod_sn_37449","vodId":"37449","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"赤发的白雪姬","name_cn":"赤发的白雪姬","date":"2015-01-01","year":"2015","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/18a55a3a293b0a843d8782ab559158c9.jpg"},"summary":"个性活泼开朗的白雪（早见沙织 配音）拥有一头美丽炫目的红发，从小生活在深山之中，令白雪拥有着超越常人的敏锐和活力。让白雪没有想到的是，自己竟然即将被迫嫁给好色而又愚笨的拉冀王子（福山润 配音）为妾，桀骜不驯的白雪发誓绝不向命运屈服。在留下了一束红发之后，白雪离开了家乡　　在前往邻国的途中，白雪邂逅了克拉利涅斯王国的二皇子千（逢坂良太 配音），跟随着千的，是忠心耿耿的两位侍从木木（名冢佳织 配音）和光秀（梅原裕一郎 配音）。在得知了千的真实身份之后，白雪决定放弃自己的一切，追随千来到他的王国，辅佐千，成为他的左膀右臂。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:52:30","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/EHu8yXJh311/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/gAnyuyd6Tr1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/bjc93ebkTe1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/kRVUAu0Lfa1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/riRkjPczDF1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/LakenvNhZG1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/NqbbwxuQC11/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/UncBdMsvmm1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/b6dYCpP6jg1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/n9FwLTL2em1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/1rAa0dDd6F1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/SkkJqvjTk21/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:10.786Z"}